ss=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><i>There is a band of thieves who bully the tunnels near the factory.</i><br/>\n<br/>\nThe biggest spawn is <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33659,31958,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33659, 31958, 12)</a>.\n</p><p>There are three major Glooth bandit spawns, west, south and east. Both west and east are accessible as soon as you reach the 300 points needed to enter the Glooth factory. The south spawn requires the mission \"Glooth Bandits\" from the Oramond Quest in order to reach the full spawn.\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Paladins:</b><br/>\nIf you want good experience/hour, use <a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin%20Star\">Assassin Stars</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Caldera\">Divine Caldera</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball%20Rune\">Great Fireball Runes</a>. Recommended for level 200+ only.<br/>\n<br/>\n<b>Mages:</b><br/>\nUse physical-protective gear and <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball%20Rune\">Great Fireball Runes</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Bandit\"><img alt=\"Glooth Bandit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"34\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Bandit_cbbc97.gif\" width=\"35\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Bandit\">Glooth Bandit</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,000</td><td style=\"text-al